 Marino"},{"@id":"urn:fogweave:node:n%3A2ef6e37a2b5f%3Ac1","@type":["fw:Claim"],"label":"The European Commission signed Association Agreements with Andorra and San Marino.","url":"https://www.brusselstimes.com/eu-affairs/2368520/eu-agreement-brings-andorra-san-marino-into-internal-market?utm_term=Autofeed&utm_medium=Social&utm_source=Twitter","quote":"The European Commission has signed an Association Agreement with Andorra and San Marino","verdict":"supported","independentDomains":2,"supports":2,"contradicts":0},{"@id":"urn:fogweave:node:n%3A2ef6e37a2b5f%3Ac2","@type":["fw:Claim"],"label":"The deals aim to provide greater legal certainty and predictability for citizens, businesses and public authorities.","url":"https://www.brusselstimes.com/eu-affairs/2368520/eu-agreement-brings-andorra-san-marino-into-internal-market?utm_term=Autofeed&utm_medium=Social&utm_source=Twitter","quote":"It said the deal is intended to provide \"greater legal certainty and predictability\" for citizens, businesses and public authorities","verdict":"unverified","independentDomains":1,"supports":1,"contradicts":0},{"@id":"urn:fogweave:node:n%3A2ef6e37a2b5f%3Ac3","@type":["fw:Claim"],"label":"Updated Monetary Agreements were also signed with Andorra and San Marino to address overlaps with the new Association Agreement.","url":"https://www.brusselstimes.com/eu-affairs/2368520/eu-agreement-brings-andorra-san-marino-into-internal-market?utm_term=Autofeed&utm_medium=Social&utm_source=Twitter","quote":"The EU has also signed updated Monetary Agreements with Andorra and San Marino to address overlaps with the new Association Agreement","verdict":"unverified","independentDomains":1,"supports":1,"contradicts":0},{"@id":"urn:fogweave:node:n%3A2ef6e37a2b5f%3Ac4","@type":["fw:Claim"],"label":"The Council of the EU will request the European Parliament’s consent before concluding the Association Agreement.","url":"https://www.brusselstimes.com/eu-affairs/2368520/eu-agreement-brings-andorra-san-marino-in