/","quote":"On the opposite end of the spectrum, the team identified what could be the reddest star ever recorded-WD J1011+2845","verdict":"unverified","independentDomains":1,"supports":0,"contradicts":0},{"@id":"urn:fogweave:node:topic%3Apublic%20interest%20in%20astronomy","@type":["fw:Topic"],"label":"public interest in astronomy"},{"@id":"urn:fogweave:node:org%3Ascience%20education%20programmes","@type":["fw:Organisation"],"label":"science education programmes"},{"@id":"urn:fogweave:node:n%3Ae40e07b73237","@type":["fw:NewsItem"],"label":"A truck loses control and runs over devotees outside a temple in Gwalior, Madhya Pradesh, India, killing at…","url":"https://www.dawn.com/news/2038010/out-of-control-truck-kills-13-at-religious-festival-in-indias-madhya-pradesh","date":"2026-10-18","outlet":"dawn.com"},{"@id":"urn:fogweave:node:wd%3AQ1188","@type":["fw:Place"],"label":"Madhya Pradesh","sameAs":"http://www.wikidata.org/entity/Q1188"},{"@id":"urn:fogweave:node:wd%3AQ668","@type":["fw:Place"],"label":"India","sameAs":"http://www.wikidata.org/entity/Q668"},{"@id":"urn:fogweave:node:ev%3Atruck%20runs%20over%20devotees%20in%20gwalior","@type":["fw:Event"],"label":"Truck runs over devotees in Gwalior"},{"@id":"urn:fogweave:node:n%3Af5225c9d8fb5","@type":["fw:NewsItem"],"label":"Kenya confirms four additional cases of Bundibugyo ebolavirus, including three health workers who treated…","url":"https://www.france24.com/en/live-news/20261017-four-more-ebola-cases-detected-in-kenya-bringing-total-to-seven","date":"2026-10-17","outlet":"france24.com"},{"@id":"urn:fogweave:node:wd%3AQ974","@type":["fw:Place"],"label":"Democratic Republic of the Congo","sameAs":"http://www.wikidata.org/entity/Q974"},{"@id":"urn:fogweave:node:wd%3AQ1036","@type":["fw:Place"],"label":"Uganda","sameAs":"http://www.wikidata.org/entity/Q1036"},{"@id":"urn:fogweave:node:wd%3AQ3870","@type":["fw:Place"],"label":"Nairobi","sameAs":"http://www.wikidata.org/entity/Q3870"},{"@id":"urn:fogweave:node:wd%3AQ3